{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be two-digit integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is obtained by reversing the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. The integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd9b0749e14ec633274a59bad09c03f3a27e0bff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}-y^{2}=m^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/2871b391f606ea213aedbf61bf8fa230b9185275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/d/68d550b49a434668404ce5216c7d5235f2c5aa6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 88    \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 112   \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 116   \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 144   \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 154   \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/78449572731577b2fbbc9e0d64b11005f2a9e1f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a865a2be3ebe9610a3ece120c80347d5b161c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=10b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are nonzero digits.\n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/8/1b8088e58252db3fe978b651bf66d791f79fb190.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-y^2=(x+y)(x-y)\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75db726bece8fe4b6cf1036ff0d80353d418f83.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(10a+b+10b+a)(10a+b-10b-a)\\]\" width=\"320\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d794211b54da0f1669ac78864b06348267c4fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(11(a+b))(9(a-b))\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>For this product to be a square, the factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> must be repeated in either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be092b2283c00c376e719c5f650a15433d43a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f2aee761704bb62a779d1bbcb9fb09912bb516f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, and given the constraints it has to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/9/4796b039c76437d4854531dec77460e365129bcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. The factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is already a square and can be ignored. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f2aee761704bb62a779d1bbcb9fb09912bb516f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> must be another square, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or greater then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f2aee761704bb62a779d1bbcb9fb09912bb516f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/678e8d321bc28e3701dea3719943d09b7ac3555b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d303726270444ccaa7dda6468e29f180ffbba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)+(a-b)=11+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6c55d8f4e726cd0766ef97fc846854e019058d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15ab853f2f5c89cfa5328b6ed2113d984063b618.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=15/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, which is not a digit. Hence the only possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Now we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/366b555520ae2e14234749fd4398a3d06d6c5acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)+(a-b)=11+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/0282cf4e459c6f04569c6c3a996915c8401bfe9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5507ab5a3d1f06941dabd1c26505d646367983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f69c1ec597d19324140f3130e9d63367f4b69c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/503691fd771acc6e596537d92bac9dadb7696a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=65$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed27dc23eb5b804966050e762b7dbd6628d4efed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/757562de3e55b66db25d868701e28dfdcf71fbfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=33$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6caebb64394712f675a09acf90c06b178888eb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+m=154\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"186\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=